  "details": "VRChat has many websites, but some are very redundant as of late. Consider combines existing websites into the other sites.\n\nProposed suggestion:\n\n- Combine U#, VCC, ClientSim sites into creators.vrchat.com\n\n- Remove docs.vrchat.com and port relevant content to hello.vrchat.com.\n\n - Patch notes section (IMO, VRChat shouldn't add patch notes themselves to the wiki site, let the community handle those pages.)\n\nAlso, crosslinking these sites together would be useful!\n\nFeedback post created for this ask.vrchat.com comment: https://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-22-aug-2024/26325/45",
